  'hotel-home-design-fair-polokwane-airport-2026-10-07',
  'Limpopo''s first Hotel & Home Design Fair runs at Polokwane airport until Saturday',
  'Business', '2026-10-07', 'Inside Metros', 'https://insidemetros.co.za/2026/10/07/polokwane-to-stage-three-day-design-and-hospitality-fair/',
  'The province''s first Hotel & Home Design Fair is being held at Polokwane International Airport from 8 to 10 October, open from 9am to 5pm each day.',
  'Limpopo is hosting its first Hotel & Home Design Fair this week. The venue is the T49 Hangar, which sits at the Polokwane International Airport. The fair started on 8 October and closes on 10 October, with doors open from 9am to 5pm each day.

More than 60 exhibitors are taking part, showing furniture, textiles, decor, art, lighting and hospitality products. Participants come from five provinces, with Limpopo and Gauteng among them, and range from small enterprises to established brands. The fair is organised by Gentry Business Enterprise.

The fair targets trade visitors first: lodge and hotel owners, restaurateurs, designers, architects, developers and procurement staff. Homeowners are welcome too. Organisers say the aim is to help local businesses reach buyers and to raise the province''s profile in hospitality and design.

Visitors can also catch talks from the Design Institute of South Africa, and fashion label MAXHOSA AFRICA is putting together a VIP lounge. An outdoor food and beer garden is also part of the fair. Anyone planning to attend on the final day should check with the organisers for entry arrangements.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://insidemetros.co.za/2026/10/07/polokwane-to-stage-three-day-design-and-hospitality-fair/", "https://www.getaway.co.za/travel-news/limpopo-design-fair-polokwane/"]',
  'agent'
);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO news (
  slug, title, category, published_date, source_name, source_url,
